sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Employee as Employee / Client
    participant API as FastAPI Gateway (/api/v1/support)
    participant Auth as Auth & Identity Service
    participant Graph as LangGraph Orchestrator
    participant Intent as Intent Classifier (OpenAI)
    participant Router as Deterministic Router
    participant RAG as Hybrid RAG (FAISS + BM25 + RRF + Cross-Encoder)
    participant Tool as Tool / Action Executor
    participant DB as SQLite Demo DB (enterprise.db)
    participant Observability as Observability & Prometheus

    Employee->>API: POST /api/v1/support (Query + API Key)
    activate API
    API->>Auth: Validate Credentials & Header
    activate Auth
    Note over Auth: Verify demo key & bind effective user_id<br/>Block cross-user impersonation (403)
    Auth-->>API: AuthenticatedUser (user_id, role)
    deactivate Auth

    API->>Observability: start_request_metrics(request_id)
    API->>Graph: invoke(initial_state)
    activate Graph

    Graph->>Intent: understand_request(query)
    activate Intent
    Intent-->>Graph: RequestUnderstanding (intent, entities, confidence)
    deactivate Intent

    Graph->>Router: route_request(intent, entities)
    activate Router
    Router-->>Graph: route (KNOWLEDGE | TOOL | ACTION | ESCALATION | CLARIFICATION)
    deactivate Router

    alt Route: KNOWLEDGE (Informational / RAG)
        Graph->>RAG: retrieve_and_rerank(query, top_k=5)
        activate RAG
        Note over RAG: 1. FAISS Dense Retrieval (IndexFlatL2)<br/>2. BM25Okapi Lexical Retrieval<br/>3. Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF)<br/>4. Cross-Encoder Reranker (ms-marco)
        RAG-->>Graph: Top ranked context chunks + metadata
        deactivate RAG
        Graph->>Intent: generate_rag_response(query, context)
        activate Intent
        Intent-->>Graph: Grounded response with markdown source citations
        deactivate Intent

    else Route: TOOL (Read-only status lookup)
        Graph->>Tool: execute_tool(tool_name, arguments)
        activate Tool
        Tool->>DB: Check entity ownership & query status
        DB-->>Tool: Row record (Account / Device / Ticket)
        Tool-->>Graph: Structured tool result (success/failure)
        deactivate Tool

    else Route: ACTION (Ticket Creation)
        Graph->>Tool: create_ticket(user_id, category, priority, description)
        activate Tool
        Tool->>DB: INSERT into tickets table (auto INC ID)
        DB-->>Tool: Created ticket record (INC000XXX)
        Tool-->>Graph: Action completion result
        deactivate Tool

    else Route: ESCALATION (Tier 2 / Security)
        Note over Graph: Trigger escalation logic<br/>Log security / repeated failure event
        Graph-->>Graph: Formulate human handover guidance

    else Route: CLARIFICATION (Ambiguous query)
        Note over Graph: Formulate clarification prompt for missing parameters
    end

    Graph-->>API: Final AgentState (response, status, tool_results, context)
    deactivate Graph

    API->>Observability: record_request_metrics(duration, tokens, cost)
    API-->>Employee: HTTP 200 SupportResponse (JSON with request_id, intent, status, response, sources)
    deactivate API
